# Large data: NOT committed. Raw files are re-downloadable via
# pipelines.ingest.cpc_merged_ir (see data/raw/cpc_merged_ir/manifest.json for URLs + SHA-256);
# derived data is regenerable. See README "Data and evidence" for the storage decision.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/cpc_merged_ir/
data/raw/cpc_merged_ir/*
!data/raw/cpc_merged_ir/manifest.json
!data/raw/hail_reports/
data/interim/
data/processed/

# Local-only reference material (third-party screenshot; see cleanup notes)
/WhatsApp Image*.jpeg
